WEBVTT

00:02:59.079 --> 00:03:02.288
“I’ve as much muscle as any man,
and can do as much work as any man.

00:03:02.329 --> 00:03:04.954
I’ve plowed and reaped and husked
and chopped and mowed

00:03:04.996 --> 00:03:08.454
and can any man do more than that?”

00:03:09.954 --> 00:03:13.954
Unfortunately, speakers can also
manipulate people with false sinformation

00:03:13.996 --> 00:03:16.121
that the audience thinks is true,

00:03:16.163 --> 00:03:19.288
such as the debunked
but still widely believed claim

00:03:19.329 --> 00:03:21.788
that vaccines cause autism.

00:03:22.246 --> 00:03:25.163
And finally, pathos appeals to emotion,

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:29.329
and in our age of mass media,
it is often the most effective mode.